\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0    The person who reveres Jehovah
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And walks on His path gets blessing
\par He progresses in his handiworks
\par And he gets all his daily needs
\par His outgoing and incoming
\par And all his deeds become blessing
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  His wife is likened to the vine trees
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 That are standing around his house
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0  His children are like the olive trees
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 For they his table to surround
\par Jehovah grant mother and father
\par Multiples of descendants
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Behold, its meek to shower blessings
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 On him who loves Jehovah
\par Zion, Jehovah will come thither
\par And grant you all your heart desire
\par More goodwill from Jerusalem
\par \pard        Is obtained through peace from Israel. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

